                    "subContentId": "5c9b2166-c2d6-44e3-b678-e7cfa54aca09",
                    "question": "<p>Why is a one-page or two-page memo preferred in the realm of busy decision-makers?</p>\n",
                    "answers": [
                      "<p>Decision-makers do not have the time to read lengthy papers.</p>\n",
                      "<p>Decision-makers only have short attention spans.</p>\n",
