                    "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\">What are the three tips for preparing to write a persuasive memo?</p>\n",
                    "answers": [
                      "<p dir=\"ltr\">Crystallize your pitch, provide detailed background information, and prepare your implementation strategy.</p>\n",
                      "<p>Present multiple options, provide relevant data, and include a detailed analysis.</p>\n",
                      "<p dir=\"ltr\">Start with the conclusions, prepare background information, and outline the specific and concrete steps needed for implementation.</p>\n"
